Add the Sky1 AUDSS clock controller and validated ACPI CLKT publication. Keep
the source-faithful AUDSS implementation in CIX clock code, resolve each CLKT
entry through the exact SCMI clock-provider firmware node, and register the
CIXHA018 syscon through CIX platform glue rather than a CIX match in generic
syscon code.

Provenance: mechanically reconstructed for Linux 7.2 from CIX cix-linux-main
revision bc078a383042a6c14b05c56e12390e422f893088 and the audited overlay. The
CLKT validation, provider/resource lifetime, generic syscon helper, CIX-local
ACPI provider, and complete-map publication are overlay-maintained.

